  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sahel Special Envoys Meeting</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The meeting will feature sessions discussing the central elements of the forthcoming Renewed EU Approach to the Sahel incl. improved dialogue with Sahelian states to further rule of law and basic rights; improving socioeconomic conditions and access to basic services to address humanitarian needs and curtail displacement; and fighting against mis -and desinformation to improve the information environment and the conditions for political participation and democratic transition. The meeting will also include sessions focused on the deteriorating security situation in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
